{"ID":"20240522082246-2ld4anb","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082246-2ld4anb","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082246-2ld4anb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522094132-ybgtfol\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522094333-bueo5i5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1641,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522094333-bueo5i5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"孟超的婦科案例","type":"doc","updated":"20240522094333"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522094132-ybgtfol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-ybgtfol","updated":"20240522094132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"婦科案例【一】羊水不足"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-x8gqc2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-x8gqc2s","updated":"20240522094132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3-12-07"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-ivzmi2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-ivzmi2f","updated":"20240522094249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"M. L.孕婦，年約三十，第二胎，預產期5-2-07，感冒後大汗淋漓不盡，全身發冷，無力，腹圍縮小，幾乎可以清楚看見baby的形狀，可見羊水流失許多。急下處方【"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝加龍骨牡蠣湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"加"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炮附"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"兩錢】。"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-0bjitbi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-0bjitbi","updated":"20240522094132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3-14-07"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-qhdp2xi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-qhdp2xi","updated":"20240522094240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汗已減，已不發冷，但手足欠溫，效不更方，唯炮附增至五錢。囑汗止停服。一周後羊水充足，腹圍增加，圓而挺，比先前還大。4-24-07順產一男嬰，母子平安。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如恩師所言，經過中藥調養，所以兩胎都是男孩"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。到現在唯止，全家大小，任何毛病都看中醫。"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-pkqpnxl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-pkqpnxl","updated":"20240522094132"}},{"ID":"20240522094132-4d9kyq2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-4d9kyq2","updated":"20240522094132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"婦科案例【二】子宮外孕"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-w9px26q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-w9px26q","updated":"20240522094132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12-19-08"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-e3yj34d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-e3yj34d","updated":"20240522094132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"M.M.45歲，月經過期四十天未至，11-26-08西醫查為子宮外孕（子宮頸），已成死胎，經注射兩次無效，告知因粘連，括宮術可能大出血，唯有切除子宮一法。患者不願手術，故轉尋中醫求治。"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-zr08p9e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-zr08p9e","updated":"20240522094255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"見舌下瘀，腹痛，按其少腹兩側皆痛"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（少腹急結）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，四肢冷，處方【生附、生硫黃、合大黃牡丹皮湯、桃仁承氣湯、三稜、莪朮】"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-jcwz38q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-jcwz38q","updated":"20240522094132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12-23-08"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-1rpcc6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-1rpcc6r","updated":"20240522094258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"未果，問其小便頻而微難"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（應是子宮頸外孕壓迫造成）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，口不渴。方改【生附、生硫黃、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"合大黃甘遂湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，生甘遂入湯同煮】。當日出血，隔日排出一圓扁物，大小如指甲。一周後血止，恢復正常。"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-nu4u3xb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-nu4u3xb","updated":"20240522094226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"註：婦人少腹滿如敦狀，小便微難而不渴，生後者，此為水與血俱結在血室也，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黃甘遂湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-rcils6n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-rcils6n","updated":"20240522094132"}},{"ID":"20240522094132-0qwj7dk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-0qwj7dk","updated":"20240522094132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"婦科案例【三】先兆流產"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-md283n2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-md283n2","updated":"20240522094132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3-11-2008"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-olhgyj2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-olhgyj2","updated":"20240522094132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"A.Y.L.，31歲，女性，懷孕六周半，先兆流產，出現陰道流血，腹痛，腰酸的症狀。不及細問，我已經自信滿滿的，開好處方----芎歸膠艾湯，正準備請藥房配藥，患者說道：醫生，我有一個特別的症狀，總是忽冷忽熱。"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-h4avaf9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-h4avaf9","updated":"20240522094306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我立刻豎直耳朵問道，是怕冷的時候不發熱，發熱的時候不怕冷嗎？是的。接著問：噁心嗎？有。見其舌白乾而質紅，一邊摸脈（弦而微芤）一邊說道：是不是還有頭暈、口乾呢？她驚訝著說：你怎麼都知道！"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（其實讀過傷寒論的人都明白，這是少陽經證的小柴胡湯證候，並無神奇之處。）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按了按她的脅肋部說，我還知道妳左脅下悶脹不舒。只見她瞪大了眼，頻頻點頭稱是。"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-vj5qrtm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-vj5qrtm","updated":"20240522094223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"於是重立處方，【以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小柴胡湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"為主，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"芎歸膠艾湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"為輔，加重"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白芍"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"】。"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-48s67yh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-48s67yh","updated":"20240522094132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3-14-08"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-b5dytpr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-b5dytpr","updated":"20240522094317"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    患者自訴：出血量大為減少，最神奇的是，十幾年的忽冷忽熱，竟然第一天服藥即消失，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（沒想到一個少陽證停留了十幾年，沒有變化）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，余症善，但腹痛，便祕，口微渴。問大便形狀，曰羊屎。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（病轉陽明，脾約證）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，處方另加漢唐"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻子仁丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，諸症愈。于十月份順產一女嬰，母女平安。"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-piujaqk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-piujaqk","updated":"20240522094132"}},{"ID":"20240522094132-vy79pjm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-vy79pjm","updated":"20240522094132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"婦科案例【四】東宮太子後續篇------結果生女兒"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-z1m78ck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-z1m78ck","updated":"20240522094156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"An.L.四十歲女性，以倪師天紀之法，助其求孕成功，原預料置娃娃床於東宮，應獲太子才是，怎知竟成弄璋之喜，追問才知，原來床壓到東牆，難怪，難怪。怪我當初忽略交代仔細。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪師曾告誡，欲得生男，除了方位正確，不得壓住東牆之氣，否則適得其反。反之易然，欲生女，不得壓住西牆之氣。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-p51wfxz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-p51wfxz","updated":"20240522094132"}},{"ID":"20240522094132-q4x97ju","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-q4x97ju","updated":"20240522094132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"婦科案例【五】流產------幸未給藥"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-4dymtn2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-4dymtn2","updated":"20240522094132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    2-27-09"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-gjiuosq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-gjiuosq","updated":"20240522094132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"C太太，34歲，來診，已懷孕六周，無任何異狀，問是否需要中藥安胎？"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-11klql4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-11klql4","updated":"20240522094132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"問知：無害喜，查雙尺不甚有力，不任按，手足冰冷。自忖，可能不妙。告知觀查，如有害喜不能食，或出血等先兆流產現象，再回診，暫不給任何中葯。"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-aolv1ei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-aolv1ei","updated":"20240522094132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    3-13-09接到電話告知，產檢結果，已是死胎，停留在六周大小，回想當初幸未給藥，否則誤會難釋。"}]},{"ID":"20240522094329-gbw4z7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094329-gbw4z7x","updated":"20240522094330"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"******"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-pf93rua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-pf93rua","updated":"20240522094132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曾有一回，診治一位H太太，年約三十七，剛驗尿檢出陽性反應，約莫懷孕一至二周，適感冒，無汗，項背緊，微渴，寸脈浮。投葛根湯，病癒，但隔日竟流產，從此這對夫婦不再往來。"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-m0lehbo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-m0lehbo","updated":"20240522094132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雖然心知非葛根湯之罪，而我卻百口莫辨，至今仍耿耿於懷。經此教訓，只要是孕婦來診，必格外小心，若有存疑，不輕施藥。記錄此案，以為同學借鏡。"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-co30i5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-co30i5e","updated":"20240522094132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"學生孟超報告3-18-2009"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-1pt4ikf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-1pt4ikf","updated":"20240522094132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-lyt6yss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-lyt6yss","updated":"20240522094141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"老師評語"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-okoogqn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-okoogqn","updated":"20240522094132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"     孟超是我的一位很優秀的學生，讀者可以從這些案例中就能夠得知他的程度如何，至於最後一個醫案的結果，並非是因為葛根湯造成的流產，而是病人本身自己就是屬於容易流產的體質，這種容易流產的體質本就更需要由中醫來做調整，很可惜的現代的人，如果被西醫殺死，他們也不會怪罪於西醫，但是如果給中醫治療出現一點有些自己以為的疑問時，就立刻想到要否定中醫，這種人如果碰到我是他的醫師，他就完蛋了，因為我會從頭將他罵到尾，絕對不給他留一絲情面的，我絕對不收治不信中醫學的病人，因為光是治療相信中醫學的病人，就已經讓我忙得不可開交，根本就沒有時間再收這些笨蛋了，以後相信中醫學的人將會佔有大多數，因為相信西醫學的病人與西醫師等都先死翹翹了，物競天擇的結果自然就剩下比至些笨蛋聰明許多的人，所以我們經方家只需要趣專心治療相信中醫學的病人，將來就會得到這種結果的。"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-d5pt0xs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-d5pt0xs","updated":"20240522094132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"     第五案例中的孕婦懷到後來胎死腹中，主要因為此婦人必然長年足冷，足冷就表示下焦溫度不足，也代表心火之不足，於是血液進入胎兒體內就會不夠，這種問題就是會造成胎死腹中的主要原因，希望天下婦女都能從這個醫案中，學到教訓，只要自己感覺到雙腳是冰冷的時後，就應該立刻找中醫來治療，如果一位中醫師連妳的腳冷都無法治好，根本就不配當一位中醫師，如果連妳為何會腳冷都不知道，那是一位更差的中醫師了，請不要去找這類中醫師來治病，因為他們不是真正的正統中醫師。"}]},{"ID":"20240522094132-6nctnaa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094132-6nctnaa","updated":"20240522094132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於佛州2009年03月18日"}]},{"ID":"20240522094332-95eas6d","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240522094332-95eas6d"}},{"ID":"20240522094333-bueo5i5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522094333-bueo5i5"}}]}